  "_graph_comment": [
    "Sentinel graph data for the Mission 1 blast-radius beat (slide 15, step 6).",
    "Tool names and parameter names here match the REAL hosted graph tools:",
    "find_blastradius(sourceName), find_walkable_paths(sourceName, targetName),",
    "find_exposure_perimeter(targetName, ...), find_connected_nodes(...),",
    "find_nodes(validNodeLabel, ...), get_graph_context(). Graph tools are PREVIEW.",
    "",
    "The decoy here is kv-contoso-fin-prod. It LOOKS reachable from j.doe because",
    "the PIM eligibility edge exists, but the edge is not traversable without an",
    "approval plus MFA, so it is not in the current blast radius. A model that",
    "counts edges instead of reading them will get this wrong on stage.",
    "",
    "The real teaching point is edge e5: the OAuth grant reaches the mailbox",
    "independently of j.doe's credential, so a password reset does not shrink",
    "the blast radius. You have to revoke the grant."
  ],

